  "description": "A sketch saved as QVF. Eight species, each a structure section with its chemical identity on the section object (label as the compound number, name, charge, multiplicity, SMILES, InChI, InChIKey): a radical (the chlorine atom, multiplicity 2) and two ions (oxonium +1, chloride -1). A reaction.scheme relates them in three steps: a forward step with a reagent drawn at the arrow, conditions and a yield; an equilibrium; and a retrosynthetic step whose target is its product and whose precursors are its reactants, one with coefficient 0.5. A preview section, first in the manifest, carries a PNG thumbnail and an SVG image with their media_type, and a vendor section stores its drawing as an opaque member with a media_type (spec \u00a7 4.2, \u00a7 5.1, \u00a7 5.14, \u00a7 5.15, \u00a7 7.3).",
